{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"10a45bcf2ede9deb41605171c53170d502fcae5c3b35e4565dec7e08e91d0387","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1531},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["洪水泛滥"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对挪亚说：“你和你全家都进入方舟，因为这个世代只有你在我眼中是义人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["洁净的动物，你要每样带七公七母，不洁净的动物每样带一公一母，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["飞鸟每样带七公七母，叫它们以后可以在地上繁衍后代。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为七天之后，我要在地上降雨四十昼夜，从地上毁灭我所造的一切活物。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["凡耶和华所吩咐的，挪亚都照办了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["洪水在大地上泛滥那年，挪亚六百岁了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["挪亚与妻子、儿子们和儿媳们都进了方舟，躲避洪水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["洁净的动物、不洁净的动物、飞禽和地上的一切爬虫，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["都一公一母成对地到挪亚那里，进了方舟，正如上帝对挪亚的吩咐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["七天过后，洪水在地上泛滥起来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["挪亚六百岁那年的二月",{"noteId":6},"十七日，所有深渊的泉源都裂开了，天上的水闸也打开了，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["地上大雨降了四十昼夜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["就在那天，挪亚与他的儿子闪、含和雅弗，还有挪亚的妻子和三个儿媳妇都进了方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["所有的野兽、牲畜、地上的爬虫和飞鸟都按种类进入方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["一切有生命气息的活物都成对地到挪亚那里，进入方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["所有进入方舟的动物都是一公一母，正如上帝对挪亚的吩咐。然后，耶和华关上了方舟的门。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["洪水在地上泛滥了四十天，水不断往上涨，把方舟漂了起来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["洪水来势汹汹，淹没大地，方舟漂浮在水面上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["水势越来越大，把天下各处的高山都淹没了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["水淹没了群山，高出群山七米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["地上所有的飞禽、走兽、牲畜、爬虫等动物和人类都死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["陆地上所有鼻孔有生命气息的活物都死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["地上的人类、飞禽走兽和爬虫等一切活物都被毁灭了，只剩下挪亚和跟他同在方舟里的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["洪水淹没大地一百五十天。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"“二月”按犹太历计算，本卷书所用月份都是按犹太历计算。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}